ise-crop-vlm-packets/bulk-wave-manifest.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-precise-crop-vlm-packets/bulk-wave-manifest.readback.md\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-precise-crop-vlm-packets/bulk-wave-manifest.validator-result.json\n\n## Scheduler Readback\n- Total visual-required rows: 858\n- Completed Wave 1 rows skipped on resume: 25\n- Remaining terminal-bucket rows: 833\n- Scheduled rows: 833\n- Runnable waves: 34, wave-002 through wave-035\n- Tuned shard size: 25\n- Source blocker queue: 0\n- Manual-crop blocker queue: 0\n- Priority classes: priority_immediate 126, priority_high 238, priority_standard 469\n- Wave 1 outcome tuning: 5 accepted, 6 human review, 14 manual source, acceptance rate 0.2\n- Retry/backoff and malformed-response handling policy is included in the manifest.\n- No external VLM calls were made.\n\n## Verification\n- node --check scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-bulk-crop-wave-scheduler.mjs: passed\n- npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-bulk-crop-wave-scheduler.test.js: passed, 3 tests\n- node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-bulk-crop-wave-scheduler.mjs --write: passed, validator status pass\n- node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-bulk-crop-wave-scheduler.mjs --check: passed, validator status pass and check mode pass\n- git diff --check: passed\n- npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json: passed with expected warnings for feat/1255 branch scope and the pre-commit dirty worktree\n\n## Commit\n- 86be5ba2347210836e303fea7c3dd7acae63ec5b\n\n## Blockers\n- None for the current scheduler output. Current source blocker and manual-crop queues are both empty.\n","created_at":"2026-07-04T14:09:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T14:17:04Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T14:17:04Z","merged_at":"2026-07-04T14:17:04Z","merge_commit_sha":"b7445d9eb5156eea6e409d37a23a6d0d459cebed","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false